  "description": "Blackthorn 125 C Deore 12 is a carbon trail bike with balance. Its carbon frame lightens your load and makes for a responsive ride, while 125mm of Split Pivot suspension delivers efficient pedaling, predictable braking, and excellent traction throughout its travel. A RockShox Pike fork adds 140mm trail-smoothing travel up front for a bike capable of bold lines or techy features. Our trail geometry is equal parts downhill confidence and climbing comfort for an all-around excellent ride.\n\nBlackthorn’s on-bike cargo mounts make longer trail days more manageable, with dedicated space for two bottles, your repair kit, and our EXP-R Series Trillium Top Tube Bag or a K-Edge computer mount. The Shimano Deore 12-speed drivetrain is one you can count on to shift flawlessly and always have the gear range to grunt up the steepest climbs.\n\nBlackthorn 125 C Deore 12 is the best carbon trail bike if your rides often include a side of adventure (or you want them to).",
